# organicVibes: 25 hooks for acoustic singer-songwriter and folk-pop songs (8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses,
# 4 bridges). Conversational phrasing, pentatonic shapes, sus2/sus4 and maj7 colour, gentle syncopation.

